<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Spicy Gochujang peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, lots of ginger and garlic, topped with Gochujang tofu. It&rsquo;s a 30-minute, One-pan meal! Options for gluten-free Soyfree Nutfree included. </p>



