<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="why-youll-love-spicy-peanut-butter-ramen">Why You&rsquo;ll Love Spicy Peanut Butter Ramen</h2>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>spicy-sweet-creamy broth</li>



<li>One Pot dinner</li>



<li>nut-free option</li>



<li>crispy gochujang garlic tofu is toothsome and flavorful</li>



<li>Good balance of protein.</li>



<li>Versatile, add more of less veggies to balance in the broth</li>
</ul>



