	<div class="wprm-recipe-summary wprm-block-text-normal"><span style="display: block;">Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, lots of ginger and garlic, topped with Gochujang tofu. It's a 30-minute, One-pan meal. The noodles are cooked directly in the broth, so you only need one pot. </span></div>
</div>
