<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/?tp_image_id=50582" data-pin-description="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-pin-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201200%20800'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="ramen and spicy peanut sauce ingredients in bowls on the kitchen counter" class="wp-image-50582" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6901.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6901.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6901-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6901-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6901-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6901-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6901-150x100.jpg 150w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" data-lazy-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6901.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/?tp_image_id=50582" data-pin-description="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-pin-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6901.jpg" alt="ramen and spicy peanut sauce ingredients in bowls on the kitchen counter" class="wp-image-50582" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6901.jpg" srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6901.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6901-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6901-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6901-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6901-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6901-150x100.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript></figure>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="ingredients-and-substitutions">Ingredients and Substitutions</h2>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>tofu &ndash; This is your protein. You can use <a href="https://www.veganricha.com/chickpea-flour-tofu/">chickpea tofu</a>, if you prefer. Do know that gochujang contains soy. You can make your Soyfree Gochujang and use that instead..</li>



<li>soy sauce &ndash; Adds salt and umami to the tofu flavoring and to the broth. Use tamari for gluten-free </li>



<li>gochujang &ndash; This adds a sweet heat that&rsquo;s just amazing in the peanut butter broth! You&rsquo;re using gochujang in both the tofu and in the broth.</li>



<li>garlic powder &ndash; Deepens the flavor of the tofu.</li>



<li>cornstarch &ndash; Helps the tofu get really nice and crisp. You can use tapioca starch, if you prefer.</li>



<li>sesame oil &ndash; Oil helps the tofu get crispy, and using sesame oil specifically also adds even more flavor!</li>



<li>mushrooms &ndash; These add a nice texture and flavor to the peanut butter ramen broth.</li>



<li>ginger-garlic paste &ndash; Ginger and garlic pair so well with peanut butter! You can use minced or pureed  ginger and garlic if you can&rsquo;t find ginger-garlic paste.</li>



<li>smooth peanut butter &ndash; Makes the broth creamy and gives it an amazing flavor!</li>



<li>water /stock &ndash; This bulks out the broth and cooks the noodles at the same time, in the same pan.</li>



<li>noodles &ndash; Use ramen or thin udon noodles to make this soup.</li>



<li>garnishes &ndash; Lime wedges, green onion, and sesame seeds finish this ramen.</li>
</ul>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="tips">Tips</h2>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>Make sure that you press your tofu for 15 minutes before cooking! You can prep the rest of the ingredients while the tofu presses.</li>



<li>You may not need all of the cornstarch listed. Start with two teaspoons, and see if that&rsquo;s enough to soak up the moisture, so it adheres to the tofu. If needed, add the remaining cornstarch.</li>



<li>When you add that first quarter cup of broth, whisk well to get the peanut butter to dissolve, so you won&rsquo;t have any lumps.</li>
</ul>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="how-to-make-peanut-butter-ramen">How to Make Peanut Butter Ramen</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">First, make the gochujang garlic tofu.&nbsp;</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Press and cube the tofu, and add it to a bowl.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/?tp_image_id=50583" data-pin-description="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-pin-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201200%20800'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="sliced tofu in a bowl" class="wp-image-50583" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6902.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6902.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6902-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6902-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6902-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6902-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6902-150x100.jpg 150w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" data-lazy-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6902.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/?tp_image_id=50583" data-pin-description="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-pin-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6902.jpg" alt="sliced tofu in a bowl" class="wp-image-50583" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6902.jpg" srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6902.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6902-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6902-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6902-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6902-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6902-150x100.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">In a small bowl mix the soy sauce, gochujang, garlic powder, and sesame oil and pour it over the tofu. Toss well to coat. </p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/?tp_image_id=50584" data-pin-description="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-pin-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201200%20800'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="sliced tofu in a bowl with gochujang added" class="wp-image-50584" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6906.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6906.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6906-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6906-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6906-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6906-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6906-150x100.jpg 150w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" data-lazy-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6906.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/?tp_image_id=50584" data-pin-description="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-pin-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6906.jpg" alt="sliced tofu in a bowl with gochujang added" class="wp-image-50584" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6906.jpg" srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6906.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6906-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6906-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6906-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6906-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6906-150x100.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript></figure>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/?tp_image_id=50585" data-pin-description="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-pin-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201200%20800'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="adding cornstarch to the gochujang tofu" class="wp-image-50585" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6908.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6908.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6908-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6908-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6908-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6908-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6908-150x100.jpg 150w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" data-lazy-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6908.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/?tp_image_id=50585" data-pin-description="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-pin-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6908.jpg" alt="adding cornstarch to the gochujang tofu" class="wp-image-50585" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6908.jpg" srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6908.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6908-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6908-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6908-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6908-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6908-150x100.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Add two teaspoons of the cornstarch and toss well. If the mixture is still somewhat wet, then add the rest of the cornstarch and toss well.&nbsp;</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/?tp_image_id=50586" data-pin-description="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-pin-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201200%20800'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="gochujang tofu after mixing in the cornstarch" class="wp-image-50586" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6909.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6909.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6909-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6909-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6909-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6909-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6909-150x100.jpg 150w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" data-lazy-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6909.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/?tp_image_id=50586" data-pin-description="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-pin-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6909.jpg" alt="gochujang tofu after mixing in the cornstarch" class="wp-image-50586" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6909.jpg" srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6909.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6909-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6909-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6909-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6909-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6909-150x100.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Then you can either transfer the tofu cubes to a parchment-lined baking sheet and bake it at 400&ordm;F for 20-25 minutes or you can transfer them to a hot wok or saucepan with a teaspoon of oil and cook them until they are crisp on most of the edges, about 5-6 minutes.&nbsp;</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/?tp_image_id=50587" data-pin-description="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-pin-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201200%20800'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="gochujang tofu in the frying pan, before cooking" class="wp-image-50587" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6911.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6911.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6911-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6911-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6911-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6911-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6911-150x100.jpg 150w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" data-lazy-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6911.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/?tp_image_id=50587" data-pin-description="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-pin-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6911.jpg" alt="gochujang tofu in the frying pan, before cooking" class="wp-image-50587" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6911.jpg" srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6911.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6911-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6911-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6911-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6911-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6911-150x100.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript></figure>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/?tp_image_id=50588" data-pin-description="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-pin-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201200%20800'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="gochujang tofu in the frying pan, after cooking" class="wp-image-50588" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6915.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6915.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6915-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6915-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6915-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6915-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6915-150x100.jpg 150w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" data-lazy-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6915.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/?tp_image_id=50588" data-pin-description="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-pin-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6915.jpg" alt="gochujang tofu in the frying pan, after cooking" class="wp-image-50588" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6915.jpg" srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6915.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6915-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6915-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6915-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6915-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6915-150x100.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">I use the same wok for making the tofu as well as the ramen. Remove the tofu once crisp from the pot and then make the ramen. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Add oil, mushrooms, and a good pinch of salt and cook for 2-3 minutes to brown the mushrooms on some of the edges. </p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/?tp_image_id=50589" data-pin-description="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-pin-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201200%20800'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="adding mushrooms to the pan after removing the tofu" class="wp-image-50589" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6917.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6917.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6917-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6917-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6917-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6917-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6917-150x100.jpg 150w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" data-lazy-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6917.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/?tp_image_id=50589" data-pin-description="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-pin-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6917.jpg" alt="adding mushrooms to the pan after removing the tofu" class="wp-image-50589" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6917.jpg" srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6917.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6917-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6917-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6917-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6917-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6917-150x100.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Then add the ginger-garlic paste, peanut butter, gochujang, and soy sauce and mix really well. </p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/?tp_image_id=50590" data-pin-description="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-pin-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201200%20800'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="adding ginger-garlic paste to the pan of mushrooms" class="wp-image-50590" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6919.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6919.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6919-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6919-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6919-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6919-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6919-150x100.jpg 150w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" data-lazy-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6919.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/?tp_image_id=50590" data-pin-description="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-pin-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6919.jpg" alt="adding ginger-garlic paste to the pan of mushrooms" class="wp-image-50590" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6919.jpg" srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6919.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6919-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6919-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6919-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6919-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6919-150x100.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript></figure>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/?tp_image_id=50591" data-pin-description="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-pin-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201200%20800'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="adding peanut butter and spicy gochujang to the pan of mushrooms" class="wp-image-50591" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6921.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6921.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6921-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6921-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6921-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6921-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6921-150x100.jpg 150w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" data-lazy-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6921.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/?tp_image_id=50591" data-pin-description="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-pin-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6921.jpg" alt="adding peanut butter and spicy gochujang to the pan of mushrooms" class="wp-image-50591" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6921.jpg" srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6921.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6921-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6921-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6921-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6921-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6921-150x100.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Add a 1/4 cup of the water or broth and mix in to mix the peanut butter, else it will clump up . Bring the mixture to a boil then gradually add the rest of the broth and mix in.&nbsp;</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/?tp_image_id=50592" data-pin-description="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-pin-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201200%20800'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="peanut butter mixture dissolved in hot water in the pan" class="wp-image-50592" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6923.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6923.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6923-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6923-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6923-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6923-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6923-150x100.jpg 150w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" data-lazy-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6923.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/?tp_image_id=50592" data-pin-description="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-pin-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6923.jpg" alt="peanut butter mixture dissolved in hot water in the pan" class="wp-image-50592" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6923.jpg" srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6923.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6923-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6923-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6923-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6923-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6923-150x100.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript></figure>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/?tp_image_id=50593" data-pin-description="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-pin-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201200%20800'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="spicy peanut butter broth after adding the additional water" class="wp-image-50593" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6925.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6925.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6925-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6925-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6925-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6925-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6925-150x100.jpg 150w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" data-lazy-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6925.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/?tp_image_id=50593" data-pin-description="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-pin-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6925.jpg" alt="spicy peanut butter broth after adding the additional water" class="wp-image-50593" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6925.jpg" srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6925.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6925-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6925-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6925-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6925-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6925-150x100.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Bring the broth to a good rolling boil, then add your noodles and cook them according to the time on the packaging. Ramen noodles will cook pretty quickly, within 3-4 minutes, while udon noodles will take around 7-8 minutes.&nbsp;</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/?tp_image_id=50594" data-pin-description="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-pin-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201200%20800'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="adding ramen noodles to the spicy peanut broth" class="wp-image-50594" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6928.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6928.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6928-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6928-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6928-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6928-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6928-150x100.jpg 150w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" data-lazy-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6928.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/?tp_image_id=50594" data-pin-description="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-pin-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6928.jpg" alt="adding ramen noodles to the spicy peanut broth" class="wp-image-50594" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6928.jpg" srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6928.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6928-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6928-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6928-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6928-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6928-150x100.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Once the noodles are cooked to your preference, switch off the heat. Taste and adjust salt and flavor. If you want it sweeter then you can add more maple syrup. You can add more salt if needed or some black pepper for extra heat.&nbsp;</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/?tp_image_id=50595" data-pin-description="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-pin-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201200%20800'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="noodles in the peanut broth, after cooking" class="wp-image-50595" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6931.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6931.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6931-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6931-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6931-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6931-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6931-150x100.jpg 150w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" data-lazy-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6931.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/?tp_image_id=50595" data-pin-description="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-pin-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6931.jpg" alt="noodles in the peanut broth, after cooking" class="wp-image-50595" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6931.jpg" srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6931.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6931-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6931-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6931-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6931-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6931-150x100.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Serve the broth using a ladle into your serving bowls. Then transfer some of the noodles with mushrooms to your serving bowls. Top it with the crispy tofu, lime wedge, green onions, and sesame seeds, and serve.</p>



