cy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-pin-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6937.jpg" alt="spicy peanut butter ramen in the bowl, after adding tofu and green onions" class="wp-image-50598" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="Spicy peanut butter ramen is an absolute comfort food recipe with a delicious, creamy broth, gochujang flavors, and lots of ginger and garlic. It's a 30-minute, one-pan meal!" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/spicy-peanut-butter-ramen/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Peanut Gochujang Ramen" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6937.jpg" srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6937.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6937-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6937-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6937-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6937-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Peanut-Gochujang-Ramen-6937-150x100.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript></figure>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="frequently-asked-questions">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>



<div class="schema-faq wp-block-yoast-faq-block"><div class="schema-faq-section" id="faq-question-1678713319645"><strong class="schema-faq-question">Can I make this peanut-free?</strong> <p class="schema-faq-answer">To make this recipe without peanuts, you can use sunflower butter or almond butter instead of peanut butter.&nbsp;</p> </div> <div class="schema-faq-section" id="faq-question-1680713725033"><strong class="schema-faq-question">What is gochujang?</strong> <p class="schema-faq-answer">Gochujang is a spicy-sweet Korean chili paste made from fermented glutenous rice and soybeans with red chilis and salt.</p> </div> <div class="schema-faq-section" id="faq-question-1680936947887"><strong class="schema-faq-question">Can I make this gluten-free? </strong> <p class="schema-faq-answer">Use Glutenfree noodles, use tamari instead of soy sauce. ensure that Gochujang is gluten-free&nbsp;</p> </div> <div class="schema-faq-section" id="faq-question-1680936996950"><strong class="schema-faq-question">Can I make this soy-free? </strong> <p class="schema-faq-answer">Use chickpea tofu instead of tofu, coconut aminos for the soy sauce. &nbsp;Gochujang often has soy, so use 2 teaspoons each of gochugaru pepper flakes, chickpea miso, coconut aminos and. 1 teaspoon maple syrup to make your own Gochujang.&nbsp;</p> </div> </div>

