	<li id="comment-777573" class="comment even thread-even depth-1 parent">
		<article id="div-comment-777573" class="comment-body">
			<footer class="comment-meta">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
										<b class="fn">Steve May</b> <span class="says">says:</span>				</div><!-- .comment-author -->

				<div class="comment-metadata">
					<time datetime="2026-05-07T16:34:09-07:00">May 7, 2026 at 4:34 pm</time>				</div><!-- .comment-metadata -->

							</footer><!-- .comment-meta -->

			<div class="comment-content">
				<p><img class="wprm-comment-rating" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAP///wAAACwAAAAAAQABAEACAkQBADs=" data-lazy-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/plugins/wp-recipe-maker/assets/icons/rating/stars-alt-5.svg" alt="5 stars" width="80" height="16" /><br />
We make this often.  Everyone who has eaten this has loved it.  We bake the tofu and always add extra veg, what ever is on hand, bok choi, broccoli, bell peppers, carrots or snow peas all work very well.  The broth is amazing.  This meal is so satisfying, easy and delicious.</p>
			</div><!-- .comment-content -->

			<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="#comment-777573" data-commentid="777573" data-postid="50519" data-belowelement="div-comment-777573" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Steve May" aria-label="Reply to Steve May">Reply</a></div>		</article><!-- .comment-body -->
	<ol class="children">
	<li id="comment-777633" class="comment byuser comment-author-moon odd alt depth-2">
		<article id="div-comment-777633" class="comment-body">
			<footer class="comment-meta">
				<div class="comment-author vcard">
										<b class="fn">Vegan Richa Support</b> <span class="says">says:</span>				</div><!-- .comment-author -->

				<div class="comment-metadata">
